<title>USA: OEC Medical to buy rest of Barwig Medical.</title>
<headline>OEC Medical to buy rest of Barwig Medical.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>OEC Medical Systems Inc said on Monday that it would purchase 100 percent of the remaining equity of Barwig Medical Systems.</p>
<p>OEC Medical Systems purchased 19.8 percent of the German manufacturer last year.</p>
<p>OEC Medical manufactures and markets medical imaging systems and accessories for fluoroscopic intraoperative and interventional applications.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
</text>
